'''Animal Allegiance''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] that causes nearby animals to fight for you.

{{NewLeft}}
== Related Quests ==
* {{Quest Link|Angarvunde (quest)}}
* {{Quest Link|Glory of the Dead}}

==Possible Uses==
*Evening the odds if outnumbered.
*Forcing peaceful animals to stop so they can be killed while hunting.
*Forcing [[Skyrim:chaurus|chaurus]] and [[Skyrim:Frostbite Spider|frostbite spiders]] to attack their [[Skyrim:Falmer|Falmer]] keepers.
*Turning [[Skyrim:Mammoth|mammoths]] against their [[Skyrim:Giant|giants]].

== Notes ==
* When the shout is used and a follower is already actively fighting an animal, the animal will continue to fight your follower.
* The shout penetrates doors and walls, so it can be used to start a fight between chaurus and Falmer in areas of caves that you have not yet accessed.
* This shout cannot be used to directly counter a [[Skyrim:Spriggan|spriggan]]'s similar power after the spriggan has already cast it, as the original power takes precedence.
* The word wall at [[Skyrim:Ysgramor's Tomb|Ysgramor's Tomb]] can be reached by [[Skyrim:Mountain Climbing|climbing the mountain]], bypassing the need to complete [[Skyrim:Glory of the Dead|Glory of the Dead]].
